==Battleground==
*1 [[Golden Doge]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*6 [[Golden Doge]]s spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Gold Hippoe]] spawns as the boss.
**6 [[Golden Doge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

